{"id":"n56010-1-10","stage":4,"title":"몰두하다 · 埋头","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n56010-1-10-1","ko":"민준이가 뭘 하길래 저렇게 조용해?","zh":"敏俊在做什么呢，怎么这么安静？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"민준이가","meaning":"敏俊","explanation":"민준：敏俊；이：名词后缀，构成派生名词。；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"민준이가","audio":"/audio/2d578794e58a65e57305.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"뭘","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么；ㄹ：을/를 的缩略，标记宾语，如 뭘＝무엇을。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"2","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하길래","meaning":"表示前句所指的事实为后句的理由或根据。","explanation":"하다：表示前句所指的事实为后句的理由或根据。；길래：说明说话人据以采取行动的原因或发现。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62899","senseId":"2","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"저렇게","meaning":"那样","explanation":"저렇다：那样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"저렇다","audio":"/audio/07e99c1628a5077b51a7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71226","senseId":"1","lemma":"저렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"조용해?","meaning":"文静","explanation":"조용하다：文静；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"조용하다","audio":"/audio/1cd9dc985df28c4908a7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58167","senseId":"2","lemma":"조용하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不确定的对象或无需指明名字的对象。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示前句所指的事实为后句的理由或根据。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"62899","definition":"表示前句所指的事实为后句的理由或根据。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"07e99c1628a5077b","term":"저렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/07e99c1628a5077b51a7.mp3","entryId":"71226","definition":"性质、模样、状态等与那个一样。","pronunciation":["저러타"]},{"id":"1cd9dc985df28c49","term":"조용하다","zh":"文静","audio":"/audio/1cd9dc985df28c4908a7.mp3","entryId":"58167","definition":"寡言少语，行为斯文。","pronunciation":["조용하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/cb2e3475e3544abbfa20.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n56010-1-10-2","ko":"지금 독서에 몰두하고 있거든.","zh":"他现在正专心读书呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지금","meaning":"现在，这会儿","explanation":"지금：现在，这会儿","readings":[{"term":"지금","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62523","senseId":"1","lemma":"지금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"독서에","meaning":"读书","explanation":"독서：读书；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"독서","audio":"/audio/65842003806ebef2a058.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"48896","senseId":"1","lemma":"독서","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"몰두하고","meaning":"埋头，专注","explanation":"몰두하다：埋头，专注；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"몰두하다","audio":"/audio/91ae7fef5df53b460a27.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"56010","senseId":"1","lemma":"몰두하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있거든.","meaning":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","explanation":"있다：正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）；거든：补充理由或背景，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"df159f47a890ff65","term":"지금","zh":"现在，这会儿","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3","entryId":"62523","definition":"在说话的当时；或此时此刻。","pronunciation":["지금"]},{"id":"65842003806ebef2","term":"독서","zh":"读书","audio":"/audio/65842003806ebef2a058.mp3","entryId":"48896","definition":"阅读书籍。","pronunciation":["독써"]},{"id":"91ae7fef5df53b46","term":"몰두하다","zh":"埋头，专注","audio":"/audio/91ae7fef5df53b460a27.mp3","entryId":"56010","definition":"专心致志地做一件事，不分散精力。","pronunciation":["몰뚜하다"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/ccc2e44e9764ad6801f6.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.425,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=56010","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":126,"sequenceScore":2.2517,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["他现在正专心读书呢。","没有猪肉可以放进泡菜汤里了。","敏俊在做什么呢，怎么这么安静？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["他现在正专心读书呢。","敏俊在做什么呢，怎么这么安静？","没有猪肉可以放进泡菜汤里了。"],"answer":0}]}
